Priority: optional
Maintainer: hakergeniusz <hakergeniusz@users.noreply.github.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper (>= 10), rustc, cargo
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/hakergeniusz/rustfetch

Package: rustfetch
Architecture: any
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1
Description: A fastfetch- and hyfetch-inspired system information tool written in Rust
 A fast, dependency-light system information tool written in Rust, inspired by
 fastfetch and hyfetch. It mirrors fastfetch's logo database, colors and
 modules, reading system information directly from procfs, sysfs, DMI and
 pci.ids.
 .
 The binary is self-contained apart from the standard C runtime libraries
 (libc6 and libgcc-s1). The fastfetch package is NOT required at runtime.
